{"4453370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Your Meow-jesty!", "steam_appid": 4453370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Meow-jesty! is a short experience of 30-60 minutes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4453370/extras/48757880eabad332ce477df7812fc9d3.poster.avif?t=1776908452\" width=1014 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4453370/extras/48757880eabad332ce477df7812fc9d3.webm?t=1776908452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4453370/extras/48757880eabad332ce477df7812fc9d3.mp4?t=1776908452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a little kitty with big dreams. On an island in the sky you can explore, cause a ruckus, pick a fight and, if you believe in yourself, claim your rightful crown. Explore a colourful castle town filled with townsfolk to annoy and things to knock over while you go on an adventure to become your royal meow-jesty!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4453370/extras/7b590d54213852bab86defba82e9c546.poster.avif?t=1776908452\" width=964 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4453370/extras/7b590d54213852bab86defba82e9c546.webm?t=1776908452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4453370/extras/7b590d54213852bab86defba82e9c546.mp4?t=1776908452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Villagers to harass</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yarn to chase</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balloons to pop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guard to distract</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meow</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4453370/extras/dae72f9db57012592848dc3889435162.poster.avif?t=1776908452\" width=966 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4453370/extras/dae72f9db57012592848dc3889435162.webm?t=1776908452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4453370/extras/dae72f9db57012592848dc3889435162.mp4?t=1776908452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Meow-jesty! is a short experience of 30-60 minutes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4453370/extras/48757880eabad332ce477df7812fc9d3.poster.avif?t=1776908452\" width=1014 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4453370/extras/48757880eabad332ce477df7812fc9d3.webm?t=1776908452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4453370/extras/48757880eabad332ce477df7812fc9d3.mp4?t=1776908452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a little kitty with big dreams. On an island in the sky you can explore, cause a ruckus, pick a fight and, 